repository-code: 'https://github.com/maehr/zenodo-uploader'
url: 'https://github.com/maehr/zenodo-uploader'
abstract: >-
  A Zenodo client for the command line and for agents. Create a record from your own
  metadata or by mirroring an existing DOI, attach files, change the metadata, publish
  it, and publish new versions of it, through the Zenodo REST API. Ships an MCP server,
  an Agent Skill, and a CLI over one core.
keywords:
  - zenodo
  - doi
  - datacite
  - crossref
  - open-science
  - research-data
  - mcp
  - model-context-protocol
  - agent-skill
